	Display Name=Goblin Chum
	Description=Word has gone round the warrens that a human walks among the Horde and has not yet been eaten.  You are a chum now, and a chum is taught the two things every goblin whelp learns first: how to move without being seen, and how to keep down what the cookpots serve.  Your Sneak skill gains 10 skill points, your carry weight is increased by 10, and you resist 10 more Poison damage.
